OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Frain remaining persistent this evening
OL,7,Fand overnight turning heavy at times,
OL,8,Fmoving off steadily south and
OL,9,Feastwards later. Temperatures a touch
OL,10,Flower compared to last night in a
OL,11,Fgentle northerly breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FNoticeably chillier on
OL,14,FWednesday, with some cloud and rain
OL,15,Faround to start, though quickly
OL,16,Fturning brighter, with a few light
OL,17,Fshowers possible. A gentle northerly
OL,18,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
